### Get all players
GET http://localhost:5008/api/players

### Get player by ID
GET http://localhost:5008/api/players/1

### Create a new player
POST http://localhost:5008/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idPlayer": 1,
  "name": "John",
  "surname": "Doe",
  "fullName": "John Doe",
  "birthday": "1995-05-15T00:00:00Z",
  "nationality": "USA",
  "position": "Point Guard",
  "physicalMetrics": [
    {
      "verticalJump": 85,
      "fatPercentage": 8,
      "benchPressWeight": 100,
      "squatWeight": 150,
      "sprintSpeed": 95,
      "weight": 80,
      "height": 185,
      "wingspan": 190,
      "dateOfMeasurement": "2024-01-15T00:00:00Z"
    }
  ]
}

### Update a player
PUT http://localhost:5008/api/players/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idPlayer": 1,
  "name": "John",
  "surname": "Smith",
  "fullName": "John Smith",
  "birthday": "1995-05-15T00:00:00Z",
  "nationality": "USA",
  "position": "Shooting Guard",
  "physicalMetrics": [
    {
      "verticalJump": 90,
      "fatPercentage": 7,
      "benchPressWeight": 105,
      "squatWeight": 155,
      "sprintSpeed": 98,
      "weight": 82,
      "height": 185,
      "wingspan": 190,
      "dateOfMeasurement": "2024-02-15T00:00:00Z"
    }
  ]
}

### Delete a player
DELETE http://localhost:5008/api/players/1

### Search players
GET http://localhost:5008/api/players/search?searchTerm=John&skip=0&take=10

### Get all sessions
GET http://localhost:5008/api/sessions

### Get session by ID
GET http://localhost:5008/api/sessions/1

### Create a new session
POST http://localhost:5008/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idSession": 1,
  "startTime": "2024-01-15T09:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2024-01-15T11:00:00Z",
  "sessionStatus": "Completed",
  "sessionType": "Training",
  "idPlayer": 1,
  "playerFullName": "John Doe",
  "metrics": [
    {
      "metricName": "Heart Rate",
      "metricValue": "165"
    },
    {
      "metricName": "Distance Covered",
      "metricValue": "5.2"
    }
  ]
}

### Update a session
PUT http://localhost:5008/api/sessions/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idSession": 1,
  "startTime": "2024-01-15T09:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2024-01-15T11:30:00Z",
  "sessionStatus": "Completed",
  "sessionType": "Training",
  "idPlayer": 1,
  "playerFullName": "John Smith",
  "metrics": [
    {
      "metricName": "Heart Rate",
      "metricValue": "170"
    },
    {
      "metricName": "Distance Covered",
      "metricValue": "5.8"
    }
  ]
}

### Delete a session
DELETE http://localhost:5008/api/sessions/1

### Search sessions
GET http://localhost:5008/api/sessions/search?searchTerm=Training&skip=0&take=10

### Get sessions by player
GET http://localhost:5008/api/sessions/player/1

### Create indexes
POST http://localhost:5008/api/index/create

### Delete indexes
DELETE http://localhost:5008/api/index/delete

### AGGREGATION ENDPOINTS ###

### Igraci sa najvećim brojem poena u nekoj sesiji (top 5)
GET http://localhost:5008/api/players/aggregations/most-points-session?limit=5

### Top 5 igraca sa najvećim max poenima u prošlih godinu dana
GET http://localhost:5008/api/players/aggregations/top-max-points-last-year

### Igraci sa najvećim minutama igre u playoff utakmicama za određenu državu (limit 5)
GET http://localhost:5008/api/players/aggregations/playoff-minutes-by-country?country=USA&limit=5

### Kompleksna agregacija - top 5 sesija po određenoj metrici za igrača (samo kvantitativne metrike)
GET http://localhost:5008/api/players/aggregations/top-sessions-by-metric?playerName=John Doe&metricName=points&limit=5

### Dostupne kvantitativne metrike
GET http://localhost:5008/api/players/aggregations/available-quantitative-metrics

### Primjer sa drugačijim parametrima
GET http://localhost:5008/api/players/aggregations/playoff-minutes-by-country?country=Serbia&limit=3

### Primjer sa drugačijom metrikom
GET http://localhost:5008/api/players/aggregations/top-sessions-by-metric?playerName=Nikola&metricName=rebounds&limit=5

### BULK DATA OPERATIONS ###

### Generate dummy data (100 players + 1000 sessions)
POST http://localhost:5008/api/players/bulk/generate-dummy-data

### Bulk insert players
POST http://localhost:5008/api/players/bulk/players
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "idPlayer": 201,
    "name": "Test",
    "surname": "Player",
    "fullName": "Test Player",
    "birthday": "1995-05-15T00:00:00Z",
    "nationality": "USA",
    "position": "Point Guard",
    "physicalMetrics": [
      {
        "verticalJump": 85,
        "fatPercentage": 8,
        "benchPressWeight": 100,
        "squatWeight": 150,
        "sprintSpeed": 95,
        "weight": 80,
        "height": 185,
        "wingspan": 190,
        "dateOfMeasurement": "2024-01-15T00:00:00Z"
      }
    ]
  }
]

### Bulk insert sessions
POST http://localhost:5008/api/sessions/bulk
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "idSession": 2001,
    "startTime": "2024-09-01T18:00:00Z",
    "endTime": "2024-09-01T20:00:00Z",
    "sessionStatus": "Completed",
    "sessionType": "Training",
    "idPlayer": 1,
    "playerFullName": "John Doe",
    "metrics": [
      {
        "metricName": "points",
        "metricValue": "25"
      },
      {
        "metricName": "assists",
        "metricValue": "8"
      },
      {
        "metricName": "rebounds",
        "metricValue": "12"
      }
    ]
  }
]